{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-distributional-connection","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:distributional-connection","kind":"remark","title":"Distributional connection at the limit","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-q-harmonic-basis-brane","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-jet-shell"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-direct-limit-algebra","tags":["distributional","connection","jet-shell"],"text":"distributional-connection.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:distributional-connection\"></a><p>At the limit <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n \\to \\infty</code>, we replace a single connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> with a distributional connection represented by the series:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  A_\\infty\n  = \n  \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\sum_{i=1}^{b_1(\\mathcal{S}_n)}\n  c_{n,i}\\alpha_{n,i},</code></pre>\n<p>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_{n,i} \\in \\mathbb{C}</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\{\\alpha_{n,i}\\}</code> is the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-harmonic basis (<a href=\"#rem:q-harmonic-basis-brane\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-harmonic basis on branes</a>). This transforms the gauge field into a harmonic expansion across the infinite jet space <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">J^\\infty \\mathcal{S}</code> (<a href=\"#rem:jet-shell\">jet shell</a>).</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/distributional-connection.md","heading":"Remark","number":"5.8.7"}
